# Maps the @teamzira scope to GitHub Packages. The template doesn't depend on
# any @teamzira package by default (it uses the shadcn + Alloy-token replica),
# so this line is inert until you opt into the real Alloy components.
#
# To opt in: run `./scripts/enable-alloy.sh` (installs @teamzira/alloy + wires
# it up). That needs a read:packages token — locally via
# `gh auth refresh -s read:packages`, and on the Vercel deploy via NODE_AUTH_TOKEN.
#
# No auth line is committed here (so installs never hard-error when the token is
# absent — important for token-free clones); the token is supplied by the
# environment when you opt in.
@teamzira:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
